{"ts":"2026-10-02T14:32:47.531Z","runId":"61232079-820a-4c5c-b902-025e42ad4f08","pipelineId":"full","event":"session_update","data":{"nodeId":"plan","agent":"Vibe Sandbox","data":{"content":{"text":"```xml\n<proposed_plan>\n<interview_state>ready</interview_state>\n\n## Approved decisions\n\n- **Error format**: `Error.message = \"Unable to <action>: [stderr] <trimmed_message>\\n[stdout] <trimmed_message>\"` with real newline, non-empty streams only, stderr before stdout. Fallback to `Error.message = \"Unable to <action>: exit code N\"` if both streams empty. Success behavior unchanged.\n- **Error.toString()**: Includes \"Error: \" prefix (default JS behavior), but `Error.message` itself does NOT include this prefix.\n- **Stream handling**: Trim whitespace from both stderr and stdout. Only include non-empty streams. Order: stderr first, then stdout if both present.\n- **Private preservation**: Keep all `private` modifiers and existing interfaces unchanged.\n- **Testing**: Add 5 tests via PUBLIC API `runCodex` with `fakeExecutor`/`sandboxScenario` in `acp-sandbox/test/runtime.test.ts`. Inject `SubprocessResult` from `sbx.create` with: both streams, stderr only, stdout only, empty streams, success case.\n- **Test constraints**: Never call `assertSuccess`/`requireSuccess` directly or via `any`. Do not modify visibility for testing.\n- **Dependencies**: No new dependencies. No changes to `package.json` or lock files.\n- **Execution**: Fresh sandbox: run `npm ci` at repo ROOT, then `npm test` at repo ROOT (builds all workspaces). Do not add `tsx` or test TS source directly.\n- **Existing tests**: Update any affected existing expectations.\n- **Pipeline**: Single vertical ticket. No ADR or glossary updates.\n- **Constraints**: Targeted reads max 100 lines. Avoid audits/transcriptions. Spec and ticket must preserve these constraints.\n- **Artifacts**: Each step produces its artifact. T01 returns actual JSON object `acp.implementation-result/v1` (not description/promise). Review returns actual JSON `acp.verification-report/v1`. Full pipeline completion required.\n</proposed_plan>\n```","type":"text"},"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk"}}}
